<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem 6.135 pct notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem 6.135 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said on Wednesday it would redeem its 6.135 percent callable notes due on September 26.</p>
<p>The security, with the CUSIP number 86387RVV1, would be redeemed in its entirety on December 26, the company said.</p>
<p>The principal and final interest payment for these notes was due and payable on December 26 to holders of record on December 24, the company said.</p>
</text>
